        "_uid": "42e86800-48f0-25d8-fb36-326b5c854f4d",
        "content": {
          "type": "doc",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "NFEH looked at the organisation's performance in 2007 and at criteria for the competition included: Environment, Health and Safety (EHS) management programme of the organization; leadership commitment; staff participation, goals and objectives; training programmes and progress; incident reporting and analysis; waste management and performance monitoring, measurement and improvement.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "The University Hospital ensures the consistency of its high quality care through a meticulous process of continual quality assurance.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
