    "show_share": true,
    "description": "In recognition of its contribution to sustainable development and environment-friendly practices, Aga Khan University Hospital , Karachi won the Annual Environment Excellence Award 2008 at a ceremony held on Wednesday, July 2, 2008. The award was part of a nationwide competition organised by the National Forum for Environment & Health in collaboration with United Nations Environment Programme.",
